+-- | Like 'mkUnivCo', but takes a 'UnivCoDeps' instead of a @[Coercion]@.
+mkUnivCoFromDeps
+  :: HasDebugCallStack
+  => UnivCoProvenance
+  -> UnivCoDeps -- ^ Coercions on which this depends
